<div id="@_d.I.ClassName" style="display: contents">
    <main id="main"><section class="plain-hero"><div class="wrap narrow"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT US</p><h1>Familiar support for a new chapter.</h1><p class="hero-lead">Just Budget Home Loans is part of Just Budget. It is a place to explore mortgage and property lending options with a team that starts by understanding you.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap content-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHY WE ARE HERE</p><h2>Financial needs do not stand still.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>As life changes, your home loan needs can change too. You may be looking for a different structure, buying a home, considering an investment or thinking carefully about the equity in your property.</p><p>Our approach is straightforward: listen first, explain the options clearly, and talk through the costs and risks as well as the possibilities. Any lending decision depends on your circumstances and a lender’s assessment.</p><a class="text-link dark" href="/jbhl/contact">Speak with our team ↗</a></div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="wrap cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">A conversation can be a good start</p><h2>Let’s talk about your next step</h2><p>Tell us what you are hoping to do. Our team can help you understand the next step.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="/jbhl/contact">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="tel:1300795775" class="text-link light">Or call 1300 795 775</a></div></div></section></main>
